Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.71,0:00:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：凭借 No.卡的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能够映照出未来的秀太。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的照片上，映出了我在决斗中落败{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟乘坐的飞艇将会坠落的未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.45,0:00:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你打趴下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后一定要救出小鸟！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀太）留给你的回合还有2次。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，尽管放马过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朝着那已经确定的败北未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…小鸟，我绝对要救你！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《拜拜伤害！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤阿查查弓手！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿查查弓手在召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予５００点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（我我我弓箭手）我我我～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶～！ 成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.31,0:00:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过我看穿了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:00:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:01:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会受到５００点伤害这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有你接下来会从手牌中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择陷阱卡 拜拜伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.27,0:01:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖放这件事 我都知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.03,0:01:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 证据照片。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不可能…》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体：游马手牌中的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.41,0:01:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜拜伤害是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的１只怪兽被攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽不会被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己虽然会受到伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但会将受到的伤害翻倍{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.55,0:01:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里我本来想把拜拜伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.61,0:01:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖下去的……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.41,0:01:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了，盖下去就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.41,0:01:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反正也没别的招了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.81,0:01:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《他拍下的照片里会映出未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那个未来是真的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.90,0:01:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们……就没有胜算！》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.59,0:03:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）小鸟酱，听得见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）明里姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没受伤吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.59,0:03:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没……没有……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞艇里面现在是什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个，开始冒烟了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}晃得好厉害……大家都慌了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（爆炸声与尖叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事，冷静点！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会去救你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要打起精神来，听到了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，凭借望远镜头效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一张手牌，攻击力提升４００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，独家射手的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了３０００。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是就这样被攻击的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我虽然会受到１８００点的大伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但只要发动拜拜伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能把双倍的３６００点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}施加到那家伙身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但是，那家伙他一定……》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……我从手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡，夜摄！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.99,0:04:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 在对手场上盖放的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}魔法・陷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}阱卡{\fnYusei Magic}中 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}选择{\fnYusei Magic}1{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}张{\fnYusei Magic}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.39,0:04:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 要选哪边呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.93,0:04:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选的卡是 右边！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜拜伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再进一步 召唤丑闻狙击手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 由于我的手牌减少了2张{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}独家射手 的攻击力 下降800。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.15,0:04:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此 攻击力也足够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧 独家射手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.87,0:05:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击阿查查弓箭手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.43,0:05:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用丑闻狙击手 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（丑闻狙击手）啊哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.15,0:05:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丑闻狙击手 的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过攻击给对手玩家造成伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丑闻狙击手的等级上升２级
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且　从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡　超量框架！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.53,0:05:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合　你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}除了怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}兽{\fnYusei Magic}・超量以外无法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}进{\fnYusei Magic}行攻{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}击{\fnYusei Magic}！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来所有准备都完成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了　我的回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来　终于到第５回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会　按照这张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.89,0:05:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在第５回合召唤霍普{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在第６回合输给我。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是什么人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非相关人员禁止入内！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在　是紧急情况！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这边也是这可是人命关天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞艇的运行负责人是你？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.87,0:06:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是、是的……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在情况怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}左侧引擎故障导致起火。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且驾驶员目前因事故陷入昏迷。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}远程操作呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有，那种装置……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没有什么办法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡，轰轰巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.65,0:06:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在手牌里的怪兽卡应该只有那一张。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要轰轰巨人的召唤成功的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能把墓地里的轰轰魔像可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后你凑齐2只等级4的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会召唤出霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你的宿命。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，召唤霍普吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是你的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了，小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}引擎……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个引擎！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我，小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在我就把这家伙速见秀太打趴下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会救你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒速见学长是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 认识这家伙吗！？你认识这家伙吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}认识 但是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）为什么游马会和速见前辈决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}引发事故的就是这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？这家伙被 No.附身了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.81,0:07:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有能自由操纵未来的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.67,0:07:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那股力量 到处
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拍下了事故的独家照片！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 亲眼看到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在联系你之前看到了快要坠落的飞艇的照片！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而它现在 变成了现实！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…… 前辈是前辈不是会做那种事的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）前辈拍的照片总是那么温柔{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.41,0:08:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让看的人感到幸福…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了独家照片竟然做出那么过分的事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.49,0:08:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难以置信！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙已经{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是小鸟认识的速见秀太了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.者会增幅所依附之人的欲望。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明知道小鸟会坐上去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还觉得飞艇掉下来就好了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是想象了一下而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这对我来说也是悲剧啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前辈！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.88,0:08:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的想象会直接变成照片。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且那必定会化为现实。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀太）虽然对观月君有点过意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.91,0:08:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但那时脑海中浮现的影像{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为报道摄影师我可不能错过。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实我已经和以前的我不同了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起让人感到温馨的照片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我觉醒于拍摄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更具冲击力的独家照片。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那天起……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡是Numbers。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从得到它的时候起我就变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我变得能够自由自在地
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拍摄独家照片了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要　更加更加给社会带来冲击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想搞到独家新闻。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.81,0:09:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是这么想的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅仅一张 No.卡就有这么大的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是能得到更多{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定能成为世界第一的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}报道摄影师。参加决斗嘉年华
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是为了这个。你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都搞错了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗不是复仇的工具{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不是用来满足
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那欲望的工具！不管你怎么叫嚣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你都赢不了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经只能沿着我铺好的轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续走下去了，没有别的路。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少胡说八道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先说清楚{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}投降我可不认。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.93,0:10:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你必须通过决斗败给我，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被夺走 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.99,0:10:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是已经定好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决定自己未来的，只有自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决定的是自己……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.75,0:10:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能让你这种人决定小鸟还有我的未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤隆隆隆巨灵！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对，就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动怪兽效果，从墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将隆隆隆石人守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为使用了这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆巨人也会变成守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然只能召唤霍普没别的办法了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那意味着要沿着他铺好的轨道前进。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:11:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别急游马 迷惘的时候就停下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 去寻找自己的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}违背他的预言{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的道路 新的未来或许就会打开。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}违背预言的话 会有怎样的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在等待着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连我也不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 能决定自己未来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有自己 这话是你说的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？ 你不是已经接受命运了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 召唤霍普 召唤吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.55,0:11:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会按照你的预言行动呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这就回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:11:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这就回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回、回合结束是什么意思啊，那个！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别自作主张啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.05,0:12:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了吧就像这张证据照片一样……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你召唤了隆隆隆石人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和隆隆隆巨人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在第5回合召唤出 No.39希望皇霍普{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在第6回合那只霍普会被我破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后你的 No.就会成为我的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的未来已经定好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}照片什么的才不管呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，不会走在你所铺设的轨道上。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管等待着怎样的未来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.53,0:12:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都要走我自己的路我已经决定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，你的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运是无法违抗的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.19,0:12:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤恐慌狗仔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.07,0:13:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动恐慌狗仔的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡解放，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让独家狙击手的等级提升２级。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就有２只等级６的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将独家狙击手和
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丑闻狙击手叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤　现身吧　No.２５！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全金属摄影滑翔　聚焦之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现了 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（喊叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的 没事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！聚焦之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必杀影杀·射击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备表示的隆隆隆石人1回合只有一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中 不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动聚焦之力的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}聚焦之力 1回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方发动怪兽效果的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以无效那个效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊！聚焦之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（秀太）灵魂·开发！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是聚焦之力的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈哈～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.22,0:14:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，这样一来就不会变成他拍下的照片那样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把轰轰魔像破坏掉，你想怎样！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只靠轰轰巨人是召唤不出霍普的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然如我所料……他的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过是在预先铺设好的轨道上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.07,0:14:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都不想一味奔跑罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:15:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他借助 No.之力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将未来拍成照片的能力确实是事实。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.16,0:15:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但那终究{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他按下快门终究只是瞬间的影像。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他至今为止之所以能一路赢到现在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是因为被拍下照片的对手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法从那个结果中逃脱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被反复灌输这一点言语的咒缚…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但是 游马在那次回合结束中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}斩断了那道咒缚》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}照片并没有确定未来的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.75,0:15:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 骗人的… 我不承认。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我所想象之外的未来什么的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.65,0:15:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种照片 根本没有意义！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来已经改变了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一味依赖 No.卡的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有磨练决斗的本领 这一点显而易见…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 这个男人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经不是我的对手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.23,0:15:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用 No.卡是打不倒的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想赢我的话就把霍普召唤出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.91,0:16:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定 会救你的～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 叠光猫头鹰！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 叠光猫头鹰的 怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 支付自己的生命值６００{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}将{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}对{\fnYusei Magic}手的１只怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}兽{\fnYusei Magic}・超量怪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}兽{\fnYusei Magic}的→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠光单位１个 送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想！ 当对手发动怪兽效果时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用叠光单位 将那个效果…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.49,0:16:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材都会消失的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎… 啊～！糟了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你久等了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下你期待已久的霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的隆隆隆巨人跟{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:17:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量猫头鹰进行超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.84,0:17:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来了 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力是2500！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.71,0:17:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的聚变之力是2800所以{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合就…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有下个回合了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，CNo.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普进化了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.53,0:17:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.73,0:18:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，因为这个效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力也每只下降1000！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……我的未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能改变未来的可不只有你！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也能……不，无论是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要鼓起勇气一飞冲天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.45,0:18:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能改变未来！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.65,0:18:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！姐姐！已经不用担心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把秀太打倒了把 No.的力量消除了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算奇怪的力量消失了飞船上也没有变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.41,0:19:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高度正在急剧下降！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.65,0:19:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.28,0:19:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞船后方3公里处 正以猛速{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.35,0:19:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未确认飞行物体 正在接近！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.53,0:19:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切换到影像。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了啊 姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 看那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.99,0:19:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咳　咳…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.60,0:19:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的　没事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.24,0:19:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？　下落速度减弱了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}船体角度　正在恢复！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.17,0:20:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）轨道飞行器　功率全开！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道飞行器７）遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了。　真的太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈妈。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.71,0:20:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.73,0:20:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你救了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿…　要谢的话　就谢快斗那家伙吧…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.49,0:20:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！　谢了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.01,0:21:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然　决斗者大家都是伙伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别误会了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.95,0:21:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是飞船坠落，街上陷入恐慌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华也可能会被迫中止。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.19,0:21:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）速见前辈！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.91,0:21:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 难道 还在！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.43,0:21:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是的。 这是 不小心……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个 观月小姐……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你遭遇了那么危险的事真的很抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.50,0:21:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 到底做了什么……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前辈……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.70,0:21:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 总之大家都平安无事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是挺好的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.93,0:21:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼～。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相当姐姐。不错的照片嘛。你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然能拍出这么好的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.93,0:21:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那什么 No.卡根本不需要嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.55,0:21:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？啊…谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 要是早点让你帮我拍就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:21:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我成为决斗冠军的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.79,0:22:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来想象出来…。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的未来不是该由自己来决定吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯——话是这么说啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明里）你在自言自语什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.55,0:22:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（笑声）

